{
  "uid": "go-streams-topology",
  "title": "[go-streams] Topology Explorer",
  "description": "Per-node and per-edge view of a single go-streams topology: service graph, node self-time, edge flow and error hotspots. Reached from the Application Drill-Down.",
  "tags": [
    "go-streams",
    "kafka",
    "golden-signals",
    "owner:go-streams"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "30m",
      "1h"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Application (job)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(stream_node_records_total, job)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(stream_node_records_total, job)",
          "refId": "var-job"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "node",
        "label": "Node",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(stream_node_records_total{job=~\"$job\"}, stream_node_name)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(stream_node_records_total{job=~\"$job\"}, stream_node_name)",
          "refId": "var-node"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0,
        "allValue": ".+"
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [
        "go-streams"
      ],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "go-streams dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## go-streams \u00b7 Topology Explorer\n**Question this dashboard answers:** *Which topology node or edge is hot, slow, or failing?*\n\nSelect **one** `job` \u2014 the service graph mixes nodes from multiple topologies otherwise. Node IDs (e.g. `FILTER-000002`) match the output of `topology.Describe().Print()`.\n\n**Read carefully:**\n- `stream.node.latency` is *exclusive self-time*: a node's latency excludes downstream nodes, so values sum rather than nest.\n- Node/edge metrics are recorded **per processing attempt**. During a retry storm the graph's throughput exceeds the consumed rate by the retry factor \u2014 the *Processing amplification* stat makes this visible.\n"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Processing amplification",
      "description": "Source-node record rate divided by consumed-record rate \u2248 processing attempts per consumed record. ~1 is healthy; sustained values above 1 indicate retries re-traversing the topology.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(stream_node_records_total{job=~\"$job\", stream_node_type=\"source\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(messaging_consumer_messages_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1.2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Busiest node (records/s)",
      "description": "The topology node currently processing the most records per second.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(1, sum by (stream_node_name) (rate(stream_node_records_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stream_node_name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "mps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Slowest node p95",
      "description": "Highest p95 self-time across topology nodes (stream.node.latency).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(1, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, stream_node_name) (rate(stream_node_latency_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stream_node_name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Node errors/s",
      "description": "Total error rate attributed to topology nodes (stream.errors).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(stream_errors_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "mps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Topology service graph",
      "description": "Live service graph of the stream topology. Node stat = records/s (stream.node.records); edge stat = records/s flowing between nodes (stream.edge.records). Field mappings follow the go-streams observability docs (id = node name, subtitle = node type, source/target = edge endpoints) but are produced with label_replace in PromQL plus a calculateField transformation, because Node Graph matches raw field names and ignores rename transformations (grafana/grafana#54844). Remember: recorded per attempt, so retries inflate these numbers.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(sum by (stream_node_name, stream_node_type) (rate(stream_node_records_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])), \"id\", \"$1\", \"stream_node_name\", \"(.*)\"), \"subtitle\", \"$1\", \"stream_node_type\", \"(.*)\")",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "nodes",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(sum by (stream_edge_source, stream_edge_target) (rate(stream_edge_records_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])), \"source\", \"$1\", \"stream_edge_source\", \"(.*)\"), \"target\", \"$1\", \"stream_edge_target\", \"(.*)\")",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "edges",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "calculateField",
          "options": {
            "mode": "reduceRow",
            "reduce": {
              "reducer": "sum"
            },
            "alias": "mainstat",
            "replaceFields": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "names": [
                "id",
                "subtitle",
                "mainstat",
                "source",
                "target"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "nodes": {
          "mainStatUnit": "mps"
        },
        "edges": {
          "mainStatUnit": "mps"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-node detail",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "panels": []
